<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Server Broadcasts covers operator wallops and administrator announcements. They are sent from the Broadcast window or with slash commands."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_status_user}>{dgettext("help_features", "Wallops")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Wallops messages go only to users who enabled +w with /umode +w. Server operators and administrators can send them."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_warning}>{dgettext("help_features", "Announcements")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Announcements go to every connected user and bypass ignore filters. Only server administrators can send them."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Sending a Broadcast")}</.help_h4>
<ol>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Open the Start menu, then Admin, then Broadcast. The Admin group appears only for server operators and administrators."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Choose Wallops or Announce. Announce is disabled unless you are a server administrator."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Type the text in the Message box.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Click Send broadcast. The window shows whether it was sent."
    )}
  </li>
</ol>
<p>{dgettext("help_features", "From the chat input, the same messages are sent like this:")}</p>
<pre>/wallops Server maintenance in 10 minutes
/announce Server will restart at midnight</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "How People Receive Them")}
</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "A wallops arrives in the Status window, marked Wallops, with the sender's nickname."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "An announcement appears in the conversation that each person has on screen, sent by Server."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "To receive wallops, open the File menu, choose User Modes..., check Receive wallops (+w) and click Apply."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Rules and Limits")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A broadcast cannot be edited or taken back after it is sent. It reaches only the people who are connected at that moment. Nobody who connects later receives it."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-console">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Admin Console")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-wallops">{dgettext("help_features", "/wallops")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-announce">{dgettext("help_features", "/announce")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-umode">{dgettext("help_features", "/umode +w")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-broadcast">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Admin Broadcast")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
